        <subFactors xsi:type="dssmm:CompositeFactor" FactorID="196043" Name="Financial Reporting" Descr="Financial reporting enables robust analysis of company performance through delivered reports. These reports will allow individual business units to view their financial information, while parent companies can roll up all business subsidiaries and view the consolidated information. Additionally, solutions should provide user generated reporting tools that are easy to use and provide sufficient depth of and access to the financial data to permit comprehensive analysis." GW="0.017308" LW="0.123077" Hierarchy="1.6" MasterFactorID="196043">
