            <subFactors xsi:type="dssmm:LeafFactor" FactorID="196861" Name="Print copies of full disclosure MSDS accompanies all raw materials" Descr="Unlike a trade secret material safety data sheets (MSDSs) which only provides a composition range of material, a full disclosure MSDS contains the exact specifications and properties of material. This must be made available to health care providers or other officials in the case of emergency. Manufacturers must apply to the appropriate regulatory body to determine whether a trade secret MSDS can be distributed with any item in place of a full disclosure MSDS." GW="7.6E-5" LW="0.038462" Hierarchy="2.2.8.23" MasterFactorID="196861">
