          <subFactors xsi:type="dssmm:LeafFactor" FactorID="197986" Name="Option to automatically create and maintain sub-contracted POs upon creation of sub-contracted work order operations" Descr="Subcontracting/outsourcing : The process of having suppliers provide goods and services that were previously provided internally. Outsourcing involves substitution&#x2014;the replacement of internal capacity and production by that of the supplier. Often, a work order starts in the factory, and then the parts have to be sent to a subcontracting supplier (e.g., for galvanizing), and then they come back to be finished." GW="1.65E-4" LW="0.015873" Hierarchy="4.4.60" MasterFactorID="197986">
